OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum housing deal emerges in
OL,4,Awater bill debt trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FWater use rose at one hotel after it
OL,7,Fbegan housing asylum seekers under a
OL,8,FHome Office contract, a jury has heard.
OL,10,FThe trial was told businessman Sheikh
OL,11,FAbid Gulzar ran up #160,000 in unpaid
OL,12,Fwater bills across three hotels.
OL,14,FGulzar, 81, denies 10 fraud charges
OL,15,Falongside co-defendant Manasdeep Singh.
OL,17,FAt a previous hearing, Gulzar denied
OL,18,Fallegations he used a succession of
OL,19,Fshell companies to avoid paying for
OL,20,Fwater supplied to the sites.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
